page('platform','The shared advance record','Follow a sourced requirement across the tour, stop, review and export.',hero('Platform','One record for each stop.','A tour holds the signed rider. Each stop adds its venue sources, assigned reviewer, decisions and packet status.',cta('demo','Open the workbench','accent'),console(),'night')+section('What follows the requirement',steps([('Input and origin','A rider line references a document, page, version or date. The venue inventory and drawing are separate dated sources.'),('Finding and review','A proposed comparison records the suggested match, unresolved gap, responsible reviewer, explicit decision and history.'),('Packet and follow-up','The stop-specific export carries both reviewed and open findings. The coordinator maintains versions and distributes the reviewed pack.')]))+section('Inspect the data model','<div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="record-schema.json" download>Download record schema</a><a class="btn outline" href="example-record.json" download>Download sample export</a></div>')+close())
