page('pricing','Pilot and annual pricing','The first paid module is Venue Fit. Every pilot is scoped separately.',hero('Pricing','Price the decision you need to test.','The first purchase funds a comparison with your existing advance process. Event volume, available records and review coverage determine the scope.',visual=scenic.supporting_visual('pricing'))+pricemini()+section('Agree before signature',steps([('Pilot scope','List the stops, authorized documents, named reviewers, comparison method, time window and quote.'),('Annual scope','Test the subscription hypothesis against event tiers, venue count, onboarding and implementation effort. Scope each additional module independently.'),('Renewal decision','Identify the signatory and renewal owner. Review the scorecard and adverse outcomes with that buyer before any expansion.')]))+section('Pricing questions',faq(FAQs[:2]))+close())
page('results','Evaluation scorecard','Compare the same season under the manual and proposed workflows.',hero('Results & feedback','How the pilot will be scored.','Use one authorized season of advance files. Compare the signed rider, checklist and manual inventory review against the same cases in Venue Fit.','<a class="btn dark" href="evaluation-scorecard.csv" download>Download the scorecard</a>',visual=scenic.supporting_visual('results'))+section('Measures to agree before the pilot',steps([('Review minutes','Time from opening a case to a recorded disposition. Agree when pauses start and stop. Compare minutes per case on matched inputs.'),('Valid substitutions','Count reviewer-accepted alternatives against the final rental amendments and technical decisions. Define eligible cases and the denominator up front.'),('Unsupported suggestions','Count suggested fits that lack sufficient support. Record missed conflicts, false clearance and their consequences alongside speed.')]))+results+section('Who makes the go-forward decision','<p class="lead">The reviewer agrees the scoring rules and adverse outcomes. The budget owner agrees the threshold for proceeding, reviews the comparison and chooses to proceed, revise or stop. Results are pending an authorized evaluation.</p>')+close())
